% A similar argument shows that $G$ cannot contain a claw because again there will be at least one induced $P_3$ containing a diagonal, which yields a contradiction by Lemmas~\ref{lem:diagonal} and \ref{lem:itrounding}.(i). We leave the details to the reader.
