codex
A second workspace writer finished while the harness was running and replaced the draft with a stronger construction: it uses the paper’s Proposition 18 pendant-edge reduction and asks for a two-field symbolic parity certificate, keeping the answer fixed while the implicit graph has \(2^{d+1}\) vertices. I’m preserving that newer work. Its first self-test exposed two honest issues—an over-coarse canonical invariant (11/20 unrelated keys) and a one-token metadata mismatch—so I’m fixing those rather than restoring the earlier hitting-clique draft.
apply patch
