-## Problem and trust model
+This module turns Aprile, Drescher, Fiorini, and Huynh’s [*A Tight Approximation
+Algorithm for the Cluster Vertex Deletion Problem*](https://arxiv.org/abs/2007.08057)
+into exact minimum-deletion problems. The solver receives a succinct Cayley graph
+on `GF(2)^d`, extended by one pendant vertex per original vertex, and returns a
+two-field symbolic description `[w,b]` of a parity-hyperplane deletion set. The
+checker uses only XOR, parity, and integer comparisons.
 
-The source paper is Aprile, Drescher, Fiorini, and Huynh,
