Implemented the Track B generator using the paper’s Proposition 18 pendant-vertex reduction. All local G1–G9(c) gates pass. [Paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2007.08057)

Deliverables:

- [gen_2007_08057.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2007.08057/gen_2007_08057.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2007.08057/selftest_report.json)
