- [hinted transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2007.08057/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [placebo transcript](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2007.08057/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Key results:

- 0/200,000 random guesses.
- Four heuristic attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference Gaussian elimination: 8/8, 474,459 counted bit operations.
- Compact XOR route: 215 operations.
- Answer: 24 characters, 2 atoms.
- Canonical key: 140/140 relabellings invariant; 20/20 unrelated seeds distinct.

The only blocker is external: all three oracle arms received OpenRouter HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded.” No oracle attempt was scored, so the module is locally verified but not yet submission-ready. Once the key limit is replenished, rerun:

```bash
cd /home/gson/gvrepo/results/2007.08057
python3 ../../scripts/harden.py gen_2007_08057.py
```
